    "question": {
      ":question/id": "bf7d83ef-ce67-5ebb-93d5-aef64e80896e",
      ":question/problem": "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n\\frac{11\\pi}{12}=\\frac{7\\pi}{6}-\\frac{\\pi}{4},\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\right)=$ {{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x-y)=\\cos x\\cos y+\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\right)=\\cos\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{6}-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)+\\sin\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\\n&=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}\\right)+\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
