      ":question/problem": "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n-75^\\circ=225^\\circ-300^\\circ,\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(-75^\\circ\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(-75^\\circ\\right)=$ {{field-1}}",
